---
export const prerender = false;
import {requireCommunityAccess} from '../../../lib/community-access';
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MemberShowingForm from '../../../components/community-prototype/MemberShowingForm.astro';
import pilot from '../../../data/community-pilot.json';
import '../../../styles/venue-workspace.css';
const denied = await requireCommunityAccess(Astro, 'artist');
if (denied) return denied;
const {workspaceMode=false,initialArtist=null}=Astro.props;
const onlineTest=import.meta.env.MODE==='online-test';
const workspaceTabs=[['home','Home'],['profile','Profile'],['artwork','Artwork'],['showing','Showings'],['visibility','Visibility']];
---
<BaseLayout title="Artist workspace | Artists Are Jerks" noindex>
<main class="venue-workspace artist-member-workspace" data-regular-workspace={workspaceMode} data-initial-artist={initialArtist?JSON.stringify(initialArtist):undefined}>
{workspaceMode&&<p class="workspace-return"><a href="/prototype/workspaces/">← Your workspaces</a></p>}
<p>{workspaceMode ? `Private artist workspace · ${onlineTest?'Online test':'Local prototype'}` : "New artist · First visit"}</p><h1 data-setup-title>Make yourself at home</h1><p class="notice">{onlineTest?'Your profile and artwork are saved in private test storage.':'Your page and artwork are saved in prototype storage.'} Access is limited to your assigned workspace.</p>
<p data-setup-message role="status"></p><p data-setup-unavailable hidden>Please accept an approved artist invitation first. <a href="/join/">Open Join the Community →</a></p>
<div data-setup-content hidden>
{workspaceMode && <><nav class="member-tabs" aria-label="Artist workspace">{workspaceTabs.map(([value,name],index)=><button type="button" data-workspace-tab={value} aria-pressed="false">0{index+1} {name}</button>)}</nav><section class="card" data-workspace-home hidden><h2>What would you like to do?</h2><p data-workspace-overview></p><div class="actions"><button type="button" data-workspace-action="artwork">Manage artwork</button><button type="button" data-workspace-action="profile">Edit profile &amp; contact</button><button type="button" data-workspace-action="showing">Manage showings</button><button type="button" data-workspace-action="visibility">Preview &amp; visibility</button></div><p><button type="button" data-resume-guide>Walk me through setup →</button></p></section><section data-workspace-showing hidden><h2>Where your work can be seen</h2><MemberShowingForm/></section></>}
<nav class="actions" data-guided-nav aria-label="Artist setup steps">{['Profile','Contact','Artwork','Preview'].map((name,index)=><button type="button" data-setup-step={index} aria-pressed="false">{index+1} · {name}</button>)}</nav>
<form class="card" data-setup-profile><h2>Your introduction</h2><p>Your name, city, and media come from your application. Change them if needed.</p><div class="fields"><label>Artist name<input name="name" required maxlength="150"/></label><label>Home city<select name="city">{pilot.regions[0].cities.map(city=><option>{city}</option>)}</select></label><label class="full">Practice or media<input name="practice" required maxlength="200"/></label><label class="full">Short biography <small>optional</small><textarea name="bio" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="A few sentences about you and your work"/></label></div><div class="actions"><button>Save profile</button></div></form>
<form class="card" data-setup-contact hidden><h2>How may visitors contact you?</h2><p>Each detail stays private unless you choose to show it. Direct sales remain between you and the buyer.</p><div class="fields"><label class="full">Website<input name="website" type="url" placeholder="https://"/></label><label>Contact email<input name="email" type="email"/></label><label>Phone or text number<input name="phone" type="tel"/></label></div><label class="check"><input name="publicWebsite" type="checkbox"/> Show my website publicly</label><label class="check"><input name="publicEmail" type="checkbox"/> Show my email publicly</label><label class="check"><input name="publicPhone" type="checkbox"/> Show my phone number publicly for calls or texts</label><p>A private contact form can be connected later. You can publish without public contact details.</p><div class="actions"><button>Save contact information</button></div></form>
<section class="card" data-setup-artwork hidden><h2 data-artwork-form-title>Add artwork</h2><p>A clear phone photo is enough to begin. Show the whole artwork, crop away surrounding clutter, and avoid glare. Keep original colors; don’t remove white that belongs to the work.</p><p class="notice" data-artwork-publication-status></p>
<form data-member-upload><label>Artwork image<input name="image" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"/><small>JPEG, PNG, or WebP, up to 10 MB. PNG and WebP may preserve transparency.</small></label><button type="button" data-use-sample>Use clearly labeled sample artwork</button><img data-upload-preview alt="Artwork image preview" hidden style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:contain;margin-block:1rem"/>
<div class="fields"><label>Title <small>optional</small><input name="title" placeholder="Untitled" maxlength="200"/></label><label>Medium <small>optional</small><input name="medium" maxlength="200"/></label><label>Year <small>optional</small><input name="year" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4"/></label><label>Availability<select name="sale"><option value="contact">Contact the artist for price</option><option value="price">Show a price</option><option value="private">Price kept private</option><option value="not-for-sale">Not for sale</option><option value="sold">Sold</option></select></label><label data-member-price hidden>Public price (USD)<input name="price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01"/></label></div><label class="check"><input name="public" type="checkbox" checked/> Include this artwork on my public page when I publish</label><div class="actions"><button data-save-artwork>Save artwork</button><button type="button" data-cancel-artwork-edit hidden>Cancel editing</button><button type="button" data-go-preview>Preview and publish my page →</button></div><p data-upload-message role="status"></p></form><div data-member-works></div></section>
<section class="card" data-setup-preview hidden><h2>Publish your artist page</h2><p>Preview your page before making it visible. Publishing adds you to Our Artists. Artwork appears there when its “include” setting is on. A dated physical showing is required to appear in the Showing Now listings.</p><div data-setup-summary></div><div class="actions"><a data-member-preview>Preview my artist page →</a><button type="button" data-publish-member>Publish artist page</button><button type="button" data-offline-member>Take my page offline</button></div><p data-publication-message role="status"></p><p><a data-member-create-showing href="#">Create or manage a showing →</a></p><p><a href="/our-artists/">See Our Artists in the community directory →</a></p></section>
</div>
</main>
<script>import {initMemberSetup} from '../../../lib/member-setup';initMemberSetup();</script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.workspace-return{margin-bottom:.5rem}.workspace-return a{font-weight:700}.member-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));margin-block:1.5rem;background:#000;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}.member-tabs button{border:0;border-radius:0;text-align:left;background:#000;font-size:.875rem}.member-tabs button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--color-purple)}.artist-member-workspace [hidden]{display:none!important}.artist-member-workspace [data-workspace-home] h2,.artist-member-workspace [data-workspace-showing]>h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem)}
[data-member-works]{display:grid;gap:1rem;margin-top:1.5rem}[data-member-works] article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(160px,260px) 1fr;gap:1.25rem;align-items:start}[data-member-works] article>img{grid-row:1/span 4}[data-member-works] .actions{margin-top:.75rem}
@media(max-width:650px){.member-tabs{display:flex;overflow-x:auto}.member-tabs button{flex:0 0 auto}}
@media(max-width:560px){[data-member-works] article{grid-template-columns:1fr}[data-member-works] article>img{grid-row:auto}}
</style>
